abstract: "Code and derived data for a study showing that the calibration unit of a typed protein-ligand interaction set is chemistry-dependent: five direct contact classes plus water as a sixth, water-mediated class. Contains the xact Python package, run scripts, label files, per-split summary JSONs and figure-generating scripts for 750 crystal complexes across 29 targets."

keywords:
  - protein-ligand interactions
  - conformal prediction
  - uncertainty quantification
  - water-mediated interactions
  - interaction fingerprints
  - conformal risk control

